Cl, em kJ mol-1.", "type": "paragraph"}], "difficulty": "easy", "alternatives": [{"label": "A", "content": [{"text": "769,", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-e"}, {"label": "B", "content": [{"text": "-185", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-a"}, {"label": "C", "content": [{"text": "-92,5", "type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "chemicalStructure", "preset": "benzene", "caption": ""}], "stableKey": "alt-b"}, {"label": "D", "content": [{"text": "92,5.", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-c"}, {"label": "E", "content": [{"text": "185.", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-d"}], "knowledgeTopic": "Termoquímica", "sourceRevision": 1, "sourceQuestionId": "2feb6bf9-94dd-43ab-9823-13c3091bdb21"}, {"id": "4f0eda0d-09e1-4e69-816e-97547ef88297", "type": "single_choice", "answer": {"explanation": [{"text": "A soma de 25 e 17 é igual a 42.", "type": "paragraph"}], "correctStableKeys": ["alt-c"]}, "number": 4, "points": 1, "skills": [{"code": "EF07MA02", "primary": true}], "source": {"year": 2026, "institution": "Caderno BNCC"}, "statement": [{"text": "Quanto é o resultado da soma de vinte e cinco com dezessete?", "type": "paragraph"}], "difficulty": "easy", "alternatives": [{"label": "A", "content": [{"text": "40", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-b"}, {"label": "B", "content": [{"text": "32", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-a"}, {"label": "C", "content": [{"text": "52", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-d"}, {"label": "D", "content": [{"text": "42", "type": "paragraph"}], "stableKey": "alt-c"}], "knowledgeTopic": null, "sourceRevision": 1, "sourceQuestionId": "1e8011c9-7f0a-4788-9e61-022a08c0e802"}], "assessment": {"id": "589e0c41-1aea-4694-b554-89c1b88e8bce", "grade": "Ensino Médio", "title": "Simulado multidisciplinar", "header": {"date": "", "term": "", "className": "", "teacherName": "", "institutionName": "Instituição de ensino", "transcriptionPhrase": "A persistência transforma esforço em aprendizagem."}, "subject": "Multidiscipl